            "review_title": "Review at The Real McCoy Bar",
            "review_text": "Anh Tú N\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nA cozy little pub with a warm atmosphere. Had a lovely evening here with a friend!\nSep 2026 • Friends\nSuch a lovely little pub! I came here with a friend and really enjoyed the cozy and intimate atmosphere. The place is small, warm, and beautifully decorated, which makes it feel very welcoming and comfortable.\n\nThe drinks were great and nicely made, with a good selection to choose from. The staff were also incredibly friendly and attentive, which made the whole experience even more enjoyable.\n\nIt’s a great spot to have a few drinks, chat, and just enjoy a relaxing evening. Definitely a little hidden gem that I’d love to visit again!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 22, 2026",
